{
  "case_id": "LOCK-OFFLINE-RELOG-B-1.20.1",
  "title": "立牌锁定「离线时钟漂移」修复 —— **跨重登持久化 B 相**：重登后基准仍是重登前那一拍的值（陈值），驱动一拍即按 `gap = now − last_seen` 把上界**恰好**后移同样的量，且**仍处于锁定**（未迁移到冷却）。这一相就是缺陷的**端到端复现**：修前不存在基准 ⇒ 上界按墙钟已经过期 ⇒ `isSignActiveLocked` 判未锁定 ⇒下一拍 `endLockAndStartCooldown` ⇒ 读数会看到 `lock_after=0` 且 `cd_after>0`（**缺陷判据**）。修后：`lock_end_delta == gap`（探针算成 `delta_eq_gap=1`）、`lock_after=1`、`cd_unchanged=1`。⚠️ 必须紧跟 `LOCK-OFFLINE-RELOG-A-<版本>`（中间只允许 `stop`（保留存档）+`launch` 两个动作）。⚠️ `gap` 的绝对值就是「重登期间错过的 gameTime」，随加载耗时变化 ⇒ 只断言 `gap ≥ 2`（陈值 + 确实错过）   与 `delta_eq_gap=1`（位移恰等于 gap），不写死数值。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "sign-active-lock-offline-clock-drift"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B 相（重登后）：只读确认锁定态与陈值基准 → 驱动一拍看补偿 → 再驱动一拍确认幂等。**不做任何 reset/prep**。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B1 第 1 步必须是纯只读 `signstate`：重登之后、任何驱动之前,读数应仍是**重登前**的锁定态 ——   `sign=[astral_dice:parunan_sign]`、`lock=1`、`lock_end>0`、`grace_end=0`、`last_seen>0`(陈值,尚未被刷新)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signstate RB1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B2 **主判据**:`signlag RB2 0 nowrite` = **不写基准**、只驱动一拍 ⇒ 用产品自己存下来的陈值算 gap。   期望:`gap>=2`(确实错过)、`delta_eq_gap=1`(上界位移恰等于 gap)、`seen_refreshed=1`(基准被刷新成 now)、   `lock_before=1:lock_after=1`(仍在锁定)、`cd_before=0:cd_after=0:cd_unchanged=1`(未起冷却)。   ⚠️ 若读到 `lock_after=0` + `cd_after>0`,那是**缺陷判据命中**(修前行为)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag RB2 0 nowrite",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B3 幂等复核:紧接再驱动一拍,真实 tick 已把基准刷新 ⇒ 不得再补偿(`delta_eq_gap=0`、上界不动、仍锁定)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag RB3 0 nowrite",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B4 收尾:`signreset RB9` 归零(含第 6 个键),避免锁定态跨用例残留。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signreset RB9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RB1_SIGNSTATE:.*:sign=\\[astral_dice:parunan_sign\\]:lock=1:lock_end=[1-9][0-9]*:grace_end=0:.*last_seen=[1-9][0-9]*:.*ls_api=accessor:getSignActiveLockLastSeen"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RB2_SIGNLAG:mode=nowrite:.*gap=[2-9][0-9]*:.*lock_end_before=[1-9][0-9]*:lock_end_after=[1-9][0-9]*:lock_end_delta=[1-9][0-9]*:grace_end_delta=0:cd_before=0:cd_after=0:cd_unchanged=1:lock_before=1:lock_after=1:lock_sign_after=\\[astral_dice:parunan_sign\\]:lock_sign_unchanged=1:.*delta_eq_gap=1:seen_refreshed=1:.*drives=1:tick_ran=1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RB3_SIGNLAG:mode=nowrite:.*gap=[0-9]+:lock_end_before=[1-9][0-9]*:.*lock_end_delta=0:grace_end_delta=0:cd_unchanged=1:lock_before=1:lock_after=1:.*delta_eq_gap=0:tick_ran=1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RB9_SIGNRESET:.*ls_wrote=0:ls_after=0:.*:sign=\\[\\]:lock=0:lock_end=0:grace_end=0:cd_end=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_ERR"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_EX:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": ":err="
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "Unknown or incomplete command"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "redeclaration of var"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "ls_api=none"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
